---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CTA from "../components/sections/CTA.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Nixwud Consultancy" description="Nixwud Consultancy combines strategic thinking, business understanding and modern technology to support better decisions.">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="container--wide">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Nixwud Consultancy</p>
      <h1>We help organizations think clearly before they build.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Nixwud Consultancy exists to connect business understanding with technology judgement—so leaders can make stronger decisions and build for the long term.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Our point of view</p><h2>Technology is the vehicle. Business outcomes are the product.</h2></div>
      <div>
        <p class="lede">A new platform, campaign or automation is only useful when it improves how an organization works, serves customers or grows.</p>
        <p>That is why our work begins with questions: What is changing? Where is the friction? What evidence matters? What must the organization be able to do next?</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--paper">
    <div class="container--wide">
      <p class="eyebrow paper-eyebrow">Operating principles</p>
      <div class="principle-grid grid grid--3">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>Business before technology</h3><p>Begin with context, people and outcomes—not tools.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>Clarity over complexity</h3><p>Make the important idea easier to see and act on.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>Teach before selling</h3><p>Useful thinking earns trust before a commercial conversation.</p></article>
        <article><span>04</span><h3>Measure what matters</h3><p>Connect delivery to evidence the organization values.</p></article>
        <article><span>05</span><h3>Think before building</h3><p>Reduce uncertainty before it turns into expensive rework.</p></article>
        <article><span>06</span><h3>Build for the long term</h3><p>Create systems teams can understand, operate and improve.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section border-bottom">
    <div class="container split">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Mission</p><h2>Stronger digital foundations. Sustainable growth.</h2></div>
      <div><p class="lede">Our mission is to combine strategic thinking, business understanding and modern technology to help organizations build stronger digital foundations and achieve sustainable growth.</p><p>Our long-term ambition is simple: become the company businesses learn from first and hire second.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CTA />
</Layout>

<style>
  .paper-eyebrow { color: #3554d8; }
  .principle-grid article { min-height: 15rem; padding: 1.5rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-dark); }
  .principle-grid span { color: #3554d8; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .principle-grid h3 { margin: 2.5rem 0 .8rem; }
</style>
